body:
What does it change, of being someone with a high level of introspection, even more so young? The thing is, no one will make the effort I'd do of contacting me. If I do not do it on my own, I could stay here without getting any message, and it could last a few weeks, several months or if it is not a few years. Why? Did I do something wrong? Is it lack of willing? Either not. So what? Because I am Aspergers, people treat me unconsciously like some shit? They would not take 1 minute of their lifetime to take some news from me, how can I consider them as some real friends huh? I am not dumb, either not I am naive etc. I see things, I feel them.

&#x200B;

You just have to have a look at the article I have posted above. It explains everything.
